<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Channell Commercial.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Channell Commercial.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney initiated coverage of Channell Commercial Corp as an outperform, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock was not yet open for trading late Friday morning.</p>
</text>
